+7. **Trading handoff: minimum and gas**. This skill is read-only; leave signing/execution to the user's wallet workflow. Recorded BSC Ondo quotes rejected 5 USDT with JSON code `40375` (HTTP 200), because the minimum is 5 **USD** and USDT may trade below $1. Enforce at least **6 USDT** in that integration and report a provider rejection if it still occurs; this application minimum does not guarantee future acceptance. Check JSON errors even with HTTP 200 (`40304` is a recorded caller-region rejection).
+
+   The recorded Trading API repeatedly returned `tx.gas` / `estimateGasFee` of **450000** regardless of route; a live buy reverted out of gas at that value. Obtain `eth_estimateGas` from the actual signing address for the final transaction (guard call if applicable), round up with a 1.25 margin and simulate at that exact limit. Re-estimate after approval or calldata changes; `tradeFee` is not a reliable fee for a multi-leg route. A route-length model supports approximate quote displays but cannot replace final estimation/simulation. `baw` normally estimates independently; its custom `--gasLimit` requires the user's explicit numeric instruction and successful preview.
+
+   Evidence (dated observations and limitations): [Tally F1](https://github.com/deyoungjohn/tally/blob/main/IDEAS.md#f1-market-data-and-units-2026-09-30-public-endpoints--bsc-rpc), [F4 quotes/minimum/gas](https://github.com/deyoungjohn/tally/blob/main/IDEAS.md#f4-trading-api-quotes-routes-and-fees-2026-10-01-all-runs), [F6 live fills/revert](https://github.com/deyoungjohn/tally/blob/main/IDEAS.md#f6-live-mainnet-buys-2026-10-01-burner-wallet-0x2bf7edf53bc6be6ff98f149387f3818ce28d2930-from-aws-seoul), [F10 accepted multipliers/reference/registry](https://github.com/deyoungjohn/tally/blob/main/IDEAS.md#f10-m1-engine-what-the-seoul-recordings-and-the-build-showed-2026-10-02), [F11 guard and pause checks](https://github.com/deyoungjohn/tally/blob/main/IDEAS.md#f11-m2-shareguard-v1-what-the-build-and-the-fork-tests-showed-2026-10-02).
